Verse 1:
[Ab]"There shall be showers of blessing;" This is [Eb/Bb]the promise of love;
[Fm]There shall [Ab]be [Db/Ab]seasons refreshing, Sent [Ab]from the Savior above.
[Cm]Showers of [Bbm/Db]blessing, [Ab]Showers of blessing we need;
[Ab/Eb]Mercy drops round us are falling, But for [Eb]the showers we plead.

Refrain:
[Gbdim]Showers [Fm]of blessing,
[Ab/Eb]Showers of [Eb/Bb]blessing we need;
[Fm]Mercy drops round us are [Ab]falling,
[Ab]But for the showers we plead.

Verse 2:
[Ab]"There shall be showers of [Eb/Bb]blessing;"
[Fm]Precious [Db/Ab]reviving [Ab]again;
[Cm]Over [Bbm/Db]the [Ab]hills and the valleys,
[Ab/Eb]Sound of abundance [Eb]of rain.

Verse 3:
[Ab]"There shall be showers of [Eb/Bb]blessing;"
[Fm]Send [Ab]them [Db/Ab]upon us, [Ab]O Lord;
[Cm]Grant to [Bbm/Db]us [Ab]now a refreshing;
[Ab/Eb]Come, and now honor [Eb]Thy word.

Verse 4:
[Ab]"There shall be showers of [Eb/Bb]blessing;"
[Fm]O [Ab]that [Db/Ab]today they [Ab]might fall,
[Cm]Now as [Bbm/Db]to [Ab]God were confessing,
[Ab/Eb]Now as on Jesus [Eb]we call!
